---
const inlineCode = 'rounded-sm bg-sunken text-ink px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.875em] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]'
---

<figure class="min-w-0">
  <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-raised">
    <p class="caption flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 border-b border-line px-4 py-3 text-muted sm:px-6">
      Dev chat on <code class={inlineCode}>acme/payments-api</code>
    </p>
    <ol class="space-y-6 px-4 py-6 sm:px-6">
      <li class="transcript-message">
        <span class="transcript-avatar" aria-hidden="true">CD</span>
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="title">Camille Duciel</p>
          <p class="body mt-1">
            The refund webhook retries forever when the provider answers 409. Can you find where we decide to retry?
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="transcript-message">
        <img class="transcript-avatar" src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32" />
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="title">Agent</p>
          <p class="body mt-1">
            <code class={inlineCode}>shouldRetry()</code> in <code class={inlineCode}>webhooks/refunds.ts</code> treats every
            4xx except 404 as worth retrying. A 409 means the refund already exists, so it should stop there. I'll change the
            rule and add a test.
          </p>
          <p class="caption mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 border-l-2 border-line pl-3 text-muted">
            <span>Edited 2 files</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>Ran the tests: 48 passed</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="transcript-message">
        <img class="transcript-avatar" src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32" />
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="title">Agent</p>
          <p class="body mt-1">Should a 409 also mark the refund as settled, or only stop the retries?</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="transcript-message">
        <span class="transcript-avatar" aria-hidden="true">SC</span>
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="title">Salim Condo</p>
          <p class="body mt-1">Only stop the retries. Settlement comes from the provider's own event.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="transcript-message">
        <img class="transcript-avatar" src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32" />
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="title">Agent</p>
          <p class="body mt-1">Done. The branch <code class={inlineCode}>fix/refund-409-retry</code> has one commit.</p>
          <div class="mt-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-page px-4 py-3">
            <p class="title">Stop retrying refunds on 409</p>
            <p class="caption mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-muted">
              <span>#412</span>
              <span class="rounded-sm border border-callout-edge bg-callout px-1.5 text-ink">Open</span>
              <span>2 files changed, <span class="text-code-string">+31</span> <span class="text-code-keyword">−4</span></span>
              <span>opened by Camille Duciel</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="caption mt-3 max-w-2xl text-muted">
    Salim answered the agent's question in Camille's chat. Each prompt runs on the key of the member who sent it.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
